    <h2 class="heading section_title ">B1G Numbers: Stats &amp; Facts from SIX Swiss Exchange and BME Exchange</h2>








<div class="row none">
    <div class="column_4 ">
                <div data-six-textimage="right" class="textimage ">
    <div class="figure ">
                <div class="fig image-large">
                        <figure>
            <img data-six-img='{"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/the-swiss-stock-exchange/big-numbers-1000x1000.six-image.[FORMAT].[WIDTH].png","square":[80,160,240,510,720,1020,1250,1920]}'></figure></div>
                <div class="cell">
                        </div>
                </div>
        </div></div>
    <div class="column_8 ">
                <div  class="textimage ">
    <div class="">
                    <div><p>SIX publishes its monthly “B1G Numbers” to provide the market and wider public with information on the trading and listing activity on SIX Swiss Exchange and BME Exchange. This includes the development of trading volumes, the number of trades and the performance our blue chip indices SMI and IBEX35, among other highlights.</p></div></div>
        </div>
